sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant Listener as Praxis Listener<br/>8080/TCP (configurable)<br/>optional TLS 1.2/1.3
    participant Pipeline as Filter Pipeline<br/>(in-process)
    participant Upstream as Upstream Cluster<br/>configured port
    participant Sub as Sub-request Destination<br/>(guardrails / policy callout)
    participant OTLP as OTLP Collector<br/>gRPC / HTTP
    participant Probe as Kubelet / Prometheus
    participant Metrics as Health/Metrics Listener<br/>9902/TCP HTTP
    participant Operator as Local Operator
    participant Admin as Admin API<br/>9901/TCP loopback HTTP

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 1 - Proxied HTTP request
    Client->>Listener: HTTP/1.1 or HTTP/2 request<br/>Optional TLS, optional mTLS / JWT / API key
    Listener->>Pipeline: Run request hooks (declared order)
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Auth filters (Policy, mTLS/SPIFFE, IP ACL)<br/>short-circuit on deny
    opt Guardrail / policy callout
        Pipeline->>Sub: HTTP sub-request<br/>optional TLS, authority-bound credentials
        Sub-->>Pipeline: Decision
    end
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Router + load balancer select cluster
    Pipeline->>Upstream: HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2, gRPC<br/>optional TLS (cluster CA / system roots)<br/>optional client cert / injected credential
    Upstream-->>Pipeline: Response
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Response hooks (reverse order)
    Pipeline-->>Listener: Filtered response
    Listener-->>Client: Response

    Note over Pipeline,OTLP: Flow 3 - Trace export
    Pipeline->>OTLP: OTLP spans (gRPC / HTTP protobuf)<br/>optional TLS, no auth

    Note over Probe,Admin: Flow 2 - Health, metrics and admin
    Probe->>Metrics: GET /healthy, /ready, /metrics<br/>no TLS, no auth
    Metrics-->>Probe: 200 / Prometheus text
    Operator->>Admin: GET /api/stats, /api/pipelines<br/>PUT /api/log-level, PUT/DELETE /api/kv/*<br/>no TLS, no auth (loopback bind + Host check)
    Admin-->>Operator: JSON response (421 if non-loopback Host)
